{"2698880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cellar Creek", "steam_appid": 2698880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your own adventure in the world of Cellar Creek.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit of the Rivertail Scouts, you'll explore its every nook and cranny. Help the local woodland folk, learn clever new abilities, and uncover the secrets hidden just beyond the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig, Bark, and Sniff to solve a variety of challenges!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig a canal to bring water to plants, douse flames, or discovery buried treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bark to herd animals and blast through obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniff out a trail or detect nearby secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the network of rivers and wilderness to find collectibles and new areas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your abilities improve, learn to fight against the current or take a ride on a canoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover what secrets lie within Cellar Creek...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who turned out the lights?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And don't forget to relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find comfy places all over to enjoy the sights and sounds of nature.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your own adventure in the world of Cellar Creek.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit of the Rivertail Scouts, you'll explore its every nook and cranny. Help the local woodland folk, learn clever new abilities, and uncover the secrets hidden just beyond the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/16ee804d16421c4562c87231bcc9ec16.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig, Bark, and Sniff to solve a variety of challenges!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig a canal to bring water to plants, douse flames, or discovery buried treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bark to herd animals and blast through obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniff out a trail or detect nearby secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/37e64d34ff1913a905e49756ceb41676.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the network of rivers and wilderness to find collectibles and new areas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your abilities improve, learn to fight against the current or take a ride on a canoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/07927d317ebca78b5e27d08dab003589.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover what secrets lie within Cellar Creek...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who turned out the lights?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.poster.avif?t=1786402969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.webm?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/extras/b9f4ac629af5d050e5d7a50b78c452bb.mp4?t=1786402969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And don't forget to relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find comfy places all over to enjoy the sights and sounds of nature.</p>", "short_description": "A cozy scavenger hunt about a curious little dog exploring a world carved from wood and wonder. Earn Scout Badges as you dig trails, herd woolly creatures, and sniff out secrets. Discover that even the smallest world can hold something worth remembering.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/246eb28ea6e7dbdd9e977fe89cbac8d2043bce31/header.jpg?t=1786402969", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/7a17e285a88fee294e10aef7f692656cec7655b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786402969", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/7a17e285a88fee294e10aef7f692656cec7655b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786402969", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bit processor</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Levity Cube"], "publishers": ["Levity Cube"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698880/6a350728d1791779f876ea3f714f02b3641c19af/ss_6a350728d1791779f876ea3f714f02b3641c